OL,3,AMan charged with concealing identity at
OL,4,Aprotest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with concealing
OL,7,Fhis identity at a protest in
OL,8,FPortsmouth, after police warned they
OL,9,Fwould arrest demonstrators using face
OL,10,Fmasks and coverings.
OL,12,FSeveral hundred anti-migrant protesters
OL,13,Fmarched through the city centre while
OL,14,Fanti-racism groups also made their way
OL,15,Fto Guildhall Square on Saturday.
OL,17,FHampshire Police said Timothy Miller,
OL,18,F76, of Sherwood Avenue in Hedge End was
OL,19,Fcharged with wearing or using an item
OL,20,Fto conceal identity at a protest. He is
OL,21,Fdue before Portsmouth magistrates on
OL,22,FMonday.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
